  "description": "Jang Sooho, who writes like a perfectionist and reads like an obsessive-compulsive! 'Jang Jihye' is an excellent baker, although her job is in an office! The two meet as a new employee and team leader. The two's chemistry at work is perfect, but their day-to-day coexistence is so different that the two reach a limit, and start to live together under a contract to be together even for a minute...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8857807), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/71046653), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1642010376), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Stomachtrouble), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/jang_trouble), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000082646), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260837)",
